---
description: Manifest-driven codegen — edit C# fragments, then regenerate
globs: codegen/Novolis.Raylib.Manifests/**/*.cs,codegen/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Manifests are source of truth

| Goal | Edit | Then |
|------|------|------|
| New raylib import | `Raylib6InteropManifest.cs` | `generate` |
| Public API method | `FacadesManifest.cs`, `HudManifest.cs`, or `GuiManifest.cs` | `generate` |
| Roslyn transform | `codegen/Novolis.Raylib.CodeGen.Hooks/*.cs` | `generate` |
| New interop template | `RaylibInteropEmitter.cs` + manifest row | `generate` |

```bash
dotnet run --project codegen/Novolis.Raylib.Pipeline -- run generate
dotnet run --project codegen/Novolis.Raylib.Pipeline -- run agent-verify
```

Façades emit to **`src/Novolis.Raylib.Runtime/`**. Interop emits to **`src/Novolis.Raylib.Bindings/Interop/`**.

Do not copy generated C# into manifests or hand-patch `*.g.cs`.
